<%# What a visitor who has not bought the deck sees at the top of its page:
    the cover, title, the line of details and description, "What you'll
    learn", the story teaser and the extra sections. Built from the deck
    page's own partials, so the preview cannot drift from the real page.
    The story is always the teaser (full_story: false). The slide previews,
    the price box, pours and reviews are left out.
    Rendered inside the preview frame (_preview_document) on the Listing tab,
    and on its own by Admin::PresentationsController#preview as the admin types.
    Locals: presentation (possibly unsaved), cover_image (or nil), slides_count %>
<%= render "presentations/deck_top", presentation: presentation, cover_image: cover_image, slides_count: slides_count %>
<div class="mt-12">
  <%= render "presentations/what_youll_learn", presentation: presentation %>
  <%= render "presentations/story_section", presentation: presentation, full_story: false,
             get_label: "Sign in to get this deck", get_path: "#" %>
  <%= render "presentations/extra_sections", presentation: presentation %>
</div>
